{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.poster.avif?t=1762306747\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.webm?t=1762306747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.mp4?t=1762306747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this darkly comedic horror RPG, that is charmingly similar to a bad and cheesy  horror film youd watch on Halloween night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as H.P. Lovecraft\u2019s cat, fed up with the horrendous, racist name your master gave you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You see your chance for revenge. But to kill Lovecraft, you\u2019ll need power... modern power. American power. Like a gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you tear open a portal to modern America using your masters mysterious and spooky Necronomicon. Problem is, using the Necronomicon also tore open reality itself and unleashed a flood of eldritch supernatural horrors into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, the streets crawl with terrifying cosmic abominations, and humanity teeters on the edge of madness. If you\u2019re going to survive \u2014 let alone get strong enough to defeat your former master! You\u2019ll have to fight, adapt, and grow more powerful than anything Lovecraft ever imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring goofy and hilarious full fledged cutscenes one for each of the 5 bosses.<br>Which you can rewatch anytime at the theater that neighbors the main gas station &quot;town&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >when you unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/5216d130781d4550690ecc32b384a284.poster.avif?t=1762306747\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/5216d130781d4550690ecc32b384a284.webm?t=1762306747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/5216d130781d4550690ecc32b384a284.mp4?t=1762306747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912580?t=1762306747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912580?t=1762306747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/0cfbe38cea56e48b1f4324704c762065f4dcb807/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762306747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/0cfbe38cea56e48b1f4324704c762065f4dcb807/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762306747","categories":[{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Sexual references\r\nDrug Use References\r\nBlood and violence\r\n"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912580/extras/359686c349491e24093fa4b9c5773c89.poster.avif?t=1762306747\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset